&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Manager Data Catalog&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notre Center of Excellence Data &amp;amp; AI recherche un·e Product Manager basé·e à Lille.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Decathlon, nous croyons au pouvoir du sport pour unir et inspirer. Notre mission : rendre le sport accessible au plus grand nombre, partout dans le monde. Pour y parvenir, la data est au cœur de notre stratégie, elle guide chaque décision, de la conception du produit à l&#39;expérience client Notre défi ? La rendre gouvernée, sûre et exploitable. Tu rejoindras le Data &amp;amp; AI Center of Excellence pour piloter &lt;strong&gt;Collibra&lt;/strong&gt;, notre outil de référence de data gouvernance. Ton rôle est d&#39;être le pont entre les standards de gouvernance et leur exécution digitale pour transformer chaque insight en décision stratégique.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TA FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En binôme avec un expert technique, tu es le chef d&#39;orchestre de notre solution de Data Catalog Collibra. Ton rôle est de transformer nos standards de gouvernance en une expérience produit fluide et créatrice de valeur :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vision &amp;amp; Strategy : Définir et porter la roadmap du catalogue en cohérence avec les besoins des communautés (Gouvernance, Plateforme, Producteurs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product Discovery : Identifier les fonctionnalités prioritaires en comprenant les enjeux métiers et les parcours utilisateurs (personas) et garantir l&#39;interopérabilité avec les autres briques existantes de la data platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivery Agile : Rédiger les User Stories, définir les critères d&#39;acceptation et prioriser le backlog entre valeur métier et faisabilité technique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adoption &amp;amp; Culture : Devenir l&#39;ambassadeur du catalogue en créant des supports de formation et en animant des sessions d&#39;évangélisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellence Opérationnelle : Garantir le support, la configuration de l&#39;outil (assets, workflows) et le pilotage du CSAT (satisfaction utilisateur).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;COMPETENCES REQUISES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data gouvernance&lt;/strong&gt; : Expert&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data catalog :&lt;/strong&gt; Confirmé&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data contract&lt;/strong&gt; : Confirmé&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Management&lt;/strong&gt; : Confirmé&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE TU APPORTES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tes dernières expériences t’ont permis de développer une expertise sur les standards de data gouvernance et de consolider tes connaissances en gestion de produit.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu maîtrises les concepts de qualité de donnée, de lignage (lineage) et de dictionnaire de données.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu sais transformer une vision stratégique en livrables concrets et actionnables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une première expérience significative sur Collibra (ou un outil équivalent) est un vrai atout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as la capacité à fédérer des interlocuteurs variés et à vulgariser des sujets techniques complexes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu sais arbitrer les priorités pour garantir un produit robuste et évolutif.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE NOUS T’OFFRONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organisation de travail hybride ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Matériel fourni en accord avec tes missions et nos engagements sociétaux (Mac ou Windows) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une équipe de projet locale au sein d&#39;un réseau mondial (possibilité de carrière internationale) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développement des compétences (certifications, formations internes, évolution vers des rôles de chef de projet Data Governance ou Data Manager) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Package de rémunération (participation, bonus mensuels/trimestriels)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IonQ:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2F&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=IonQ%2C+Inc&amp;amp;index=7&amp;amp;md5=0818ffbedc6dbad8c4d1611ac94c2a0f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IonQ, Inc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. [NYSE: IONQ] is the world’s leading quantum platform and merchant supplier - delivering integrated quantum solutions across computing, networking, sensing, and security. IonQ’s newest generation of quantum computers, the IonQ Tempo, is the latest in a line of cutting-edge systems that have been helping customers and partners including &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=Amazon+Web+Services%2C&amp;amp;index=8&amp;amp;md5=a7f94ee9b71a392dca3cd6c413722e51&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Amazon Web Services, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=and&amp;amp;index=9&amp;amp;md5=2bed627b388878763f41ffe0e4edb16c&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;and &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AstraZeneca&amp;amp;index=10&amp;amp;md5=757c1f2c2ec94cf3982700106122164f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AstraZeneca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; achieve 20x performance results and accelerate innovation in drug discovery, materials science, financial modeling, logistics, cybersecurity, and defense. In 2025, the company achieved 99.99% two-qubit gate fidelity, &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-achieves-landmark-result-setting-new-world-record-in-quantum-computing&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=setting+a+world+record+in+quantum+computing+performance&amp;amp;index=11&amp;amp;md5=32e9cb88afbd439026a352666cc72c91&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;setting a world record in quantum computing performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headquartered in College Park, Maryland, IonQ has operations in California, Colorado, Massachusetts, Tennessee, Washington, Italy, South Korea, Sweden, Switzerland, Canada, and the United Kingdom. Our quantum computing services are available through all major cloud providers, while we also meet the needs of networking and sensing customers across land, sea, air, and space. IonQ is making quantum platforms more accessible and impactful than ever before. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; This role is based at our Geneva, Switzerland office, with the option to work two days a week remotely.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; Up to 10%&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Job ID:&lt;/strong&gt; 1771&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;within the Quantum Platform – Devices division, you will play a key role in supporting a growing portfolio of cutting-edge products by taking ownership of day-to-day product operations. You will ensure product features are clearly defined, tracked throughout every stage of the product lifecycle and delivered successfully across cross-functional teams. Working closely with Engineering, Industrialisation, Production and Marketing, you will translate market and customer insights into product features for refinement by engineering teams, while leading the triage, planning and coordination of special customer projects. You will help optimise product lifecycle processes, ensuring efficient collaboration, smooth feature delivery and successful execution from concept through to launch.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own product operations, ensuring features are defined, tracked throughout the product lifecycle and delivered across cross-functional teams.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Translate market and customer insights into product features, while triaging, planning and coordinating special customer projects.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Partner with Engineering, Industrialisation, Production and Marketing to optimise product lifecycle processes and drive efficient product delivery.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;You will take ownership of the operational delivery of product management, ensuring products and features progress efficiently from validated requirements through development, industrialisation and commercialisation. Acting as the day-to-day product decision-maker within defined boundaries, you will drive cross-functional alignment, maintain product data integrity and coordinate delivery across multiple teams to ensure products are launched on time and to a high standard. This role is integral to enabling the Product team to scale effectively, providing operational ownership and supporting the successful delivery of an expanding product portfolio.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own the operational delivery of product management, ensuring features progress from validated requirements through development, industrialisation and commercialisation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive cross-functional alignment, maintain product data integrity and coordinate timely delivery across the product lifecycle.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Act as the day-to-day product decision-maker within defined boundaries, enabling the Product team to scale beyond a single Product Manager.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;In this role, you will take ownership of feature delivery from end to end, defining requirements and acceptance criteria, coordinating engineering handovers, validating delivery and supporting successful commercial launches. You will manage non-standard sales opportunities by assessing feasibility, making configuration decisions within agreed boundaries and documenting exceptions, while ensuring full traceability from customer requests through to delivered capability. Working closely with Engineering, Industrialisation, Production, Marketing and Sales, you will coordinate cross-functional activities to remove blockers, maintain an accurate and prioritised Jira backlog, and respond to product enquiries from Sales. You will also prepare products for launch through documentation, training, pricing and sales enablement, maintain up-to-date product documentation, communicate complex photonic, cryogenic and networking architectures to a range of stakeholders, and represent the product in customer-facing activities including pre-sales support, technical discussions and trade shows.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own end-to-end feature delivery, from requirements definition and engineering handover through to delivery validation, commercial launch and ongoing product documentation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Coordinate cross-functionally with Engineering, Industrialisation, Production, Marketing and Sales, while managing Jira backlog integrity, product enquiries and non-standard sales opportunities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Support successful product adoption by communicating complex technical architectures, ensuring launch readiness, providing pre-sales support and representing the product in customer discussions and at trade shows.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be a great fit with:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;The ideal candidate will hold a Master&#39;s degree in Engineering, Physics, Photonics, Microengineering or a related technical discipline, combined with an action-oriented mindset and the confidence to make decisions in an environment of uncertainty. You will be able to understand and reason about complex hardware products involving photonics, cryogenics and networking technologies, while communicating effectively with both technical and commercial stakeholders. You will be comfortable representing products in customer-facing situations, including technical discussions, pre-sales meetings and trade shows, and have a strong understanding of manufacturing environments, including industrialisation constraints, production realities and supply chain considerations. You will also be confident resolving conflicting priorities, negotiating with stakeholders and developing deep expertise in quantum technologies, supported by advanced Jira proficiency, including workflow configuration, automation rules and custom field management.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Master&#39;s degree in Engineering, Physics, Photonics, Microengineering or a related technical discipline, with the ability to make product decisions autonomously within defined boundaries.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong technical, commercial and customer-facing communication skills, with experience discussing complex hardware products and representing products in pre-sales meetings and trade shows.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Advanced Jira expertise, manufacturing and industrialisation knowledge, excellent stakeholder management and negotiation skills, and a genuine curiosity for deep-tech and quantum technologies.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on individual factors such as education, qualifications, and experience of the final candidate(s), specific office location, and calibration against relevant market data and internal team equity. Posted base salary figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. Our benefits include comprehensive medical, dental, and vision plans, matching 401(k), unlimited PTO and paid holidays, parental/adoption leave, legal insurance, and a home technology stipend. Details of participation in these benefit plans will be provided when a candidate receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At IonQ, we believe in fair treatment, access, opportunity, and advancement for all while striving to identify and eliminate barriers. We empower employees to thrive by fostering a culture of autonomy, productivity, and respect. We are dedicated to creating an environment where individuals can feel welcomed, respected, supported, and valued.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to equity and justice. We welcome different voices and viewpoints and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, ancestry, physical and/or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The position you are applying for will require access to technology that is subject to U.S. export control and government contract restrictions.&amp;nbsp; Employment with IonQ is contingent on either verifying “U.S. Person” (e.g., U.S. citizen, U.S. national, U.S. permanent resident, or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum) status for export controls and government contracts work, obtaining any necessary license, and/or confirming the availability of a license exception under U.S. export controls.&amp;nbsp; Please note that in the absence of confirming you are a U.S. Person for export control and government contracts work purposes, IonQ may choose not to apply for a license or decline to use a license exception (if available) for you to access export-controlled technology that may require authorization, and similarly, you may not qualify for government contracts work that requires U.S. Persons, and IonQ may decline to proceed with your application on those bases alone.&amp;nbsp; Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Non-Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Due to applicable export control laws and regulations, candidates must be a U.S. citizen or national, U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum. Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of our team and mission, we encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h4&gt;About the role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kimchi is Cast AI’s newest product: an agentic platform for running AI workloads. We are building in a greenfield space where the technology, customer expectations, and the competitive landscape shift constantly. The problem space is broad and ambiguous by design. If you are at your best when the playbook is still being written, you will thrive here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a role for maintaining a mature product line. It’s a hands-on, zero-to-one PMM job inside a startup-like team with the backing of a unicorn. You must be curious. You’ll speak directly with early customers, run messaging and channel experiments, and build Kimchi’s ICP and positioning from the ground up. Then you’ll turn that evidence into the business’s first go-to-market playbook.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll report to the Director of Product Marketing and work alongside Product, Engineering, and company leadership, with support from Content, Growth, Design, and Sales Enablement as the work scales. As a senior hire, you have the autonomy to identify quick wins independently and the judgment to balance short-term results with a longer-term roadmap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Why Cast AI?&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cast AI is an automation platform that operates cloud-native and AI infrastructure at scale. By embedding autonomous decision-making directly into Kubernetes and cloud environments, Cast AI continuously optimizes performance, reliability, and efficiency in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The old way doesn&#39;t work. As Kubernetes and AI environments grow, manual decisions don’t. Cast AI replaces tickets, alerts, and manual tuning with continuous automation that adapts infrastructure as conditions change. Efficiency and cost savings follow naturally from that automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over 2,100 companies already rely on Cast AI, including Akamai, BMW, Cisco, FICO, HuggingFace, NielsenIQ, Swisscom, and TGS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global team, diverse perspectives&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We&#39;re headquartered in Miami, but our impact is international. We take a global and intentional approach to diversity. Today, Cast AI operates across 34 countries spanning Europe, North America, Latin America, and APAC, bringing a wide range of perspectives into how we build and lead.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unicorn momentum&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;In January 2026, we achieved unicorn status with a strategic investment from Pacific Alliance Ventures, the corporate venture arm of Shinsegae Group (a $50+ billion Korean conglomerate). Our valuation now exceeds $1 billion, and we&#39;re just getting started.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us as we build the future of autonomous infrastructure.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What success looks like in 90 days&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand Kimchi’s product, the problems it solves, and its priority audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You scope the highest-priority PMM problems instead of trying to solve everything at once.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You run small experiments that produce trackable wins, including ICP hypotheses you validate or invalidate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You take senior ownership: you work independently, bring clear recommendations and trade-offs, and balance short-term execution with a longer-term roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Requirements:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of product marketing experience with technical audiences, preferably developer tools or AI tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical fluency. You can grasp nuances without an engineer walking you through every detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on, sprint-based working style with an experimental mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real experience building an ICP and messaging architecture from scratch for a product whose buying motion was not yet validated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of running customer interviews and extracting patterns that refine positioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing GTM experiments and changing direction based on what the data shows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data literacy: you can define success criteria and read funnel or adoption data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Win/loss research and competitive deal support experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound commercial judgment on pricing, packaging, and willingness to pay, even when Product owns the final call.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English, written and spoken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What would make you stand out:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have thrived in an early-stage or ambiguous product environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can point to a PMM outcome that AI meaningfully improved, whether in speed, quality, reuse, or measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent writing, backed by work samples such as positioning docs, launch content, and sales narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Responsibilities&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run deep, direct customer research to define and validate Kimchi’s ICP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own positioning and messaging, and keep it consistent as new features ship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the commercial hypothesis, audience, message, positioning, and experiment design for GTM tests across trial flow, content, and channels. Growth, Product, and Demand Gen will help execute the experiments and measure results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate Kimchi’s technical differentiation into a value story that technical buyers recognize as true.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage feature launches end to end, from early positioning through GA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the first version of sales enablement assets, battlecards, proof points, and demo narrative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain the feedback loop from customer and market signal back into roadmap input.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track the competitive landscape and share what is changing with Product and leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner directly with Engineering to keep messaging accurate as the product evolves quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain AI-assisted workflows that make this function faster, more consistent, or easier to measure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary (depending on the level of experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a flexible, remote-first global environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with a global team of cloud experts and innovators, passionate about pushing the boundaries of what’s possible in AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;356&quot;&gt;Equity options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;451&quot;&gt;Get quick feedback with a fast-paced workflow. Most feature projects are completed in 1 to 4 weeks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;554&quot;&gt;Spend 10% of your work time on personal projects or self-improvement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;628&quot;&gt;Learning budget for professional and personal development - including access to international conferences and courses that elevate your skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;841&quot;&gt;Team-building budget and company events to connect with your colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;917&quot;&gt;Equipment budget to ensure you have everything you need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;917&quot;&gt;Extra days off to help maintain a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Hiring process&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Screening call with a Recruiter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with the Hiring Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical exercise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Panel interview with the Kimchi Product Leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture Check interview with an executive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;*As part of our standard hiring process, we would like to inform you that a background check may be conducted at the final stage of recruitment through our third-party provider, Checkr.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;*Please note that Cast AI &lt;/em&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;em&gt;does not&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;em&gt; provide any form of visa sponsorship/work permit.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Vos missions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Doctolib recherche un(e) Key Account Manager Senior pour piloter ses relations avec les 6 plus grands groupes de laboratoires en France, représentant près de 75 % du marché : Cerballiance, Biogroup, Eurofins, Inovie, Synlab et Unilabs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;La consolidation du marché de la biologie médicale est bien avancée. Les grands groupes ont initié leur transformation digitale — la mission de ce poste est d&#39;y prendre toute la place possible : comprendre leurs stratégies, s&#39;y inscrire au plus tôt, les influencer, et positionner Doctolib comme le partenaire digital de référence de chaque groupe. Ce rôle combine gestion d&#39;un portefeuille de +4M€, stratégie patient de bout en bout, pilotage d&#39;une stratégie d&#39;upsell à fort impact (Patient Intake, Phone Assistant, Téléconsultation, Portail Patient) et un ownership fort dans un environnement en construction.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Vos responsabilités incluent, mais ne sont pas limitées à :&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Bâtir et piloter des plans commerciaux par groupe, avec des roadmaps adaptées et des priorités d&#39;upsell co-construites avec les clients, en naviguant dans la complexité propre au cluster (architectures multi-sites, intégrations API, cycles de vente longs, spécificités contractuelles)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Mener les négociations commerciales stratégiques avec les décideurs de haut niveau (DG, DAF, DSI, Directeurs Qualité, Biologistes référents) et développer des relations de confiance durables avec les interlocuteurs C-level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Suivre et piloter les indicateurs de performance par site et par groupe (taux d&#39;adoption, NPS, usages produits) via Metabase et les outils internes, et construire des plans d&#39;action personnalisés en lien avec les équipes Déploiement et Tech&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Participer à la définition de la stratégie patient : augmenter l&#39;usage et l&#39;adoption de bout en bout, de la prescription par le médecin à l&#39;interprétation des résultats, et être force de proposition sur chaque étape du parcours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Prévenir le churn, transformer les insatisfactions en opportunités et animer des business reviews régulières avec les comités de direction des groupes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Travailler en étroite collaboration avec le Head of cluster, les équipes PMM, Tech et Déploiement ; contribuer à la structuration des process et aux initiatives co-construites avec les groupes (événements, cas d&#39;usage, roadmap produit)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
